ritz (1.0+git20261102.7698542-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Repackage for current Debian/Ubuntu. The historical scotty dependency is
    replaced by the separate tcl-tnm package (built from the scotty source).
    The wish script is assembled from source at build time and adapted to the
    current Tnm (namespaced commands, module-name MIB loading) and to
    coreutils sha1sum for protocol auth.
  * Upstream has no releases, so the version is a snapshot of the Zino git
    tree. Upstream's own VERSION has read 1.0 since the 1990s.

 -- Morten Brekkevold <morten.brekkevold@sikt.no>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 13:30:31 +0000
